* A small program: save area, base register, a constant table.
HELLO    CSECT
HELLO    AMODE 31
HELLO    RMODE ANY
         STM   14,12,12(13)
         LR    12,15
         USING HELLO,12
         LA    2,MSG
         L     4,COUNT
         MVC   BUF(8),MSG
         MVC   BUF,MSG
         BAS   14,SUB1
         BRAS  14,SUB1
         J     DONE
SUB1     DS    0H
         BR    14
DONE     LM    14,12,12(13)
         BR    14
COUNT    DC    F'42'
MSG      DC    CL8'HELLO'
BUF      DS    CL8
TAB      DC    A(SUB1,DONE),V(EXTFN)
         DC    AD(TAB)
         DC    P'-123',Z'45',X'F1F2',B'101'
         END   HELLO
